# Kitesail Larcenist: a chosen artifact becomes "Treasure artifact" - Treasure as its only artifact type (CR 205.1a, 613.1d): Bot1 chooses
# its own Umezawa's Jitte, an Equipment, which stops being one and keeps no Jitte ability (its equip is gone). Bot2 controls no artifact
# or creature, so its slot has nothing to choose and the trigger goes on with just Bot1's choice - the choice for each player is "up to
# one" (CR 601.2c, 603.3d), a player with no choice does not stop the others.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Umezawa's Jitte
Kitesail Larcenist
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

